      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Of note, I tried adding a new Int to the animator and converting the float to an int, normalizing range 0.0 to 1.0 to 0 to 100.  Then converting that int back to a float similarly.   \n\nWhen doing this, an int of 30 with range 0 to 100 converted to a float value of 0.31 in a range of 0.0 to 1.0.   Remote people now see 0.30 while I see 0.31 - effectively reversing the problem.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
