      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2f9d3e112190752161cb38|full_name} it's not rounded to 2 decimals of precision. Remotely synced float (8 bits) values have 255 possible values, giving a precision of 1/127 (step size ~0.007874) over the network, and can store -1.0, 0.0, and 1.0 precisely.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
