      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "At any rate, the value that it's set to locally via a parameter driver should animate locally the same way that it is synced over the network.   The only thing affecting its value is the VRC Parameter Driver script in my animator - if it can only store 255 steps, then the driver should set it in 255 steps.",
