      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just as a note in case anyone finds this - my fix for this was to do a random float, then map that to an int using the VRC Parameter Driver's conversion feature.  Once that int is synced over the network, all clients re-map that into to a float in reverse and animated based on that - with all clients using the same logic, it fixes the desync.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
